:R-HSA-400451  a            owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0050796 ;
        rdfs:comment        "Free fatty acids augment the glucose-triggered secretion of insulin. The augmentation is believed to be due to the additive effects of the activation of the free fatty acid receptor 1 (FFAR1 or GPR40) and the metabolism of free fatty acids within the pancreatic beta cell. This module describes each pathway." ;
